<title>GREECE: NEW BANK OF GREECE DEPUTY GOVERNOR GARGANAS SWORN IN.</title>
<headline>NEW BANK OF GREECE DEPUTY GOVERNOR GARGANAS SWORN IN.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Bank of Greece deputy governor Nickolaos Garganas was sworn in on Thursday before the President of the Republic Costis Stephanopoulos and central bank governor Lukas Papademos, the office of the presidency said in a statement.</p>
<p>Garganas replaces outgoing deputy governor Evangelos Kourakos. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
